<Base title="Namat Health — Email confirmation" description="Namat Health waitlist email confirmation." robots="noindex, nofollow" bodyClass="document-page"><header class="site-header"><Wordmark /></header><main id="main" class="document-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Namat Health</p><h1>Thank you for your interest.</h1><p>If you arrived here after confirming your email with Brevo, your waitlist confirmation is complete.</p><p>If you haven’t received a confirmation email, check your spam folder or return to the form and try again.</p><a class="button" href="/">Back to Namat <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></main></Base>
